      "side": 1,
      "message": "Almost. I think.  The default values for the new members are brotli_ \u003d false and version_ \u003d 6.  Now we need two new test classes BrotliEmbedderTest and V5Embeddertest, say.  \n\nBrotliEmbedderTest::Setup() {\n     EmbedderTestEnvironment::GetInstance()-\u003eTearDown();\n     EmbedderTestEnvironment::GetInstance()-\u003eSetBrotliEnabled(true);\n     EmbedderTestEnvironment::GetInstance()-\u003eSetUp();\n} \n\nBrotliEmbedderTest::Teardown() {\n    EmbedderTestEnvironment::GetInstance()-\u003eTearDown();\n    EmbedderTestEnvironment::GetInstance()-\u003eSetBrotliEnabled(false);\n    EmbedderTestEnvironment::GetInstance()-\u003eSetUp();\n} \n\nSame idea with EmbedderTestV5 but call some SetVersion(5) method.",
      "parentUuid": "3ef2c0dd_5589f1ec",
      "revId": "d9264696f827daa8992cb2bffc507c29da173de9",
      "serverId": "fca2d64a-0420-3532-b200-12848c95a47b"
    },
