      "writtenOn": "2026-06-30T18:29:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "And just to make it even more complicated, to prevent future breakage, we probably need GetBrotliEnabled() to write \n\n```\nclass BrotliEmbedderTest : public EmbedderTest {\n\n  BrotliEmbedderTest::Setup() {\n    auto* environment \u003d EmbedderTestEnvironment::GetInstance();\n    old_brotli_enabled_ \u003d environment-\u003eGetBrotliEnabled();\n    environment-\u003eTearDown();\n    environment-\u003eSet\n    environment-\u003eSetBrotliEnabled(true);\n    environment-\u003eSetUp();\n  }\n\n  BrotliEmbedderTest::Teardown() {\n    auto* environment \u003d EmbedderTestEnvironment::GetInstance();\n    environment-\u003eTearDown();\n    environment-\u003eSetBrotliEnabled(old_brotli_enabled_);\n    environment-\u003eSetUp();\n  }\n  ...\n  bool old_brotli_enabled_;\n};\n\n```\n\nAnd in case it brotli enabled by default in the future, we likely need NoBrotliEmbedderTest as well, identical but with a (false) call.",
      "parentUuid": "5a63f7ba_e1d403b0",
      "revId": "d9264696f827daa8992cb2bffc507c29da173de9",
      "serverId": "fca2d64a-0420-3532-b200-12848c95a47b"
